      "class": "page-hero"
    },
    "html": "\n        <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n          <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"5\">Level 5 - Interview-ready</span>\n          <span class=\"time\">40 min</span>\n          <span class=\"chip company\">Google</span><span class=\"chip company\">Microsoft</span><span class=\"chip company\">Amazon</span><span class=\"chip company\">Flipkart</span>\n        </div>\n        <h1>Search Engine (Google Search)</h1>\n        <p class=\"lead\">Design the system that reads the whole web, builds a giant back-of-the-book index, and answers any question in a blink. You will learn the indexing pipeline, the sharded inverted index, PageRank, the scatter-gather query path, and the tail-latency tricks Google published.</p>\n      "
